      "source": [
        "# Digital Design - mod-9\n\n",
        "**Course:** digital-design\n\n",
        "Run the code cells below to practice.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Block diagram:\n  I0 \u2500\u2500\u2510\n       \u2502 MUX \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 Y\n  I1 \u2500\u2500\u2518\n       \u2502\n       S\n\nWhen S=0: Y = I0\nWhen S=1: Y = I1"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "I0 \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\n         \u2502AND\u2500\u2500\u2510\nS' \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518     \u2502\n               \u2502OR\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 Y\nI1 \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510     \u2502\n         \u2502AND\u2500\u2500\u2518\nS  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Connect A to S2, B to S1, C to S0\nThen set data inputs from truth table:\n  I0 = 0 (minterm 0 not in function)\n  I1 = 1 (minterm 1 in function)\n  I2 = 1 (minterm 2 in function)\n  I3 = 0 (minterm 3 not in function)\n  I4 = 0 (minterm 4 not in function)\n  I5 = 0 (minterm 5 not in function)\n  I6 = 1 (minterm 6 in function)\n  I7 = 1 (minterm 7 in function)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Implement F(A,B,C) using a 4-to-1 MUX:\nConnect A to S1, B to S0. Express each MUX input in terms of C:\n  AB=00: F=0,1 for C=0,1 \u2192 I0 = C\n  AB=01: F=1,0 for C=0,1 \u2192 I1 = C'\n  AB=10: F=0,0 for C=0,1 \u2192 I2 = 0\n  AB=11: F=1,1 for C=0,1 \u2192 I3 = 1"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Layer 1: Four 4-to-1 MUXes (selected by S1,S0)\n  MUX_A: inputs I0-I3   \u2192 output A\n  MUX_B: inputs I4-I7   \u2192 output B\n  MUX_C: inputs I8-I11  \u2192 output C\n  MUX_D: inputs I12-I15 \u2192 output D\n\nLayer 2: One 4-to-1 MUX (selected by S3,S2)\n  Inputs: A, B, C, D \u2192 Final output Y"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Y0 = D \u00b7 S1' \u00b7 S0'\nY1 = D \u00b7 S1' \u00b7 S0\nY2 = D \u00b7 S1  \u00b7 S0'\nY3 = D \u00b7 S1  \u00b7 S0"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "verilog",
          "// 4-to-1 Multiplexer - dataflow style\nmodule mux_4to1(\n    input  wire [3:0] data_in,\n    input  wire [1:0] sel,\n    output wire       y\n);\n    assign y = data_in[sel];\nendmodule"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "verilog",
          "// 4-to-1 Multiplexer - behavioral style\nmodule mux_4to1_behavioral(\n    input  wire [3:0] data_in,\n    input  wire [1:0] sel,\n    output reg        y\n);\n    always @(*) begin\n        case(sel)\n            2'b00: y = data_in[0];\n            2'b01: y = data_in[1];\n            2'b10: y = data_in[2];\n            2'b11: y = data_in[3];\n        endcase\n    end\nendmodule"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "verilog",
          "// Parameterized MUX using conditional operator\nmodule mux_2to1 #(parameter WIDTH = 8)(\n    input  wire [WIDTH-1:0] a,\n    input  wire [WIDTH-1:0] b,\n    input  wire             sel,\n    output wire [WIDTH-1:0] y\n);\n    assign y = sel ? b : a;\nendmodule"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "verilog",
          "// 1-to-4 Demultiplexer\nmodule demux_1to4(\n    input  wire       data_in,\n    input  wire [1:0] sel,\n    output reg  [3:0] data_out\n);\n    always @(*) begin\n        data_out = 4'b0000;\n        data_out[sel] = data_in;\n    end\nendmodule"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ],
